# EOB Matching — Supercronic Crontab
# ====================================
# Used by the eob-scheduler Docker service to run the EOB matching
# pipeline on a daily schedule. Supercronic is a cron replacement
# designed for containers (no syslog dependency, stdout logging).
#
# Schedule: Daily at 10:00 AM (server local time)
# The --since-last-run flag ensures only documents added since the
# last successful run are processed, making daily runs efficient.

# Daily EOB matching — process new documents since last run
0 10 * * * eob-match run --since-last-run --limit 200 --verbose
